  "description": "Joon-woo hates anything burdensome and just wants to enjoy a variety of pleasures. His line has always been: “As long as you’re okay with me seeing other people, I’ll date you.” But every time, that’s led to being dumped with a “trash” label and another relationship cut short. One day, he matches with Seok-min on an app and has an incredibly satisfying night with him. The next day, Joon-woo discovers that Seok-min is actually a TA in his department. From then on, he finds himself being pulled along by Seok-min—slowly losing the free-spirited lifestyle he thought he’d never give up.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/trashinbin), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/trashinbin)",
